Suggests: poppler-utils
Description: terminal and web novel reader for TXT, EPUB, PDF and Markdown
 moyu is a local novel reader with a terminal UI and a local web reader.
 It supports chapter navigation, full-text search, reading progress,
 Kindle-style typography, paper themes, and a one-key disguise screen
 in the terminal.
 .
 The web reader is started with "moyu web" and provides a cover
 bookshelf, typography controls, paged or scrolling reading, and
 page-turn animations. It can be installed as a Chrome web app and reads
 TXT, EPUB, PDF, and Markdown files from local
 directories. PDF support requires pdftotext from poppler-utils.
